.SH NAME
ssoosshd-nss-override-set - Set fields of one user's override; an empty --home or --shell clears that field.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBssoosshd-nss override set USER [--uid N] [--gid N] [--home PATH] [--shell PATH] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Set fields of one user's override; an empty --home or --shell clears that field.


